<h2><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"></path><rect height="4" rx="1" ry="1" width="8" x="8" y="2"></rect></svg> Overview</h2>
<p>Zabbix is a powerful open-source monitoring platform used by organizations worldwide. 100% free with no vendor lock-in, it offers enterprise-grade features including predictive analytics, trend prediction, and anomaly detection.</p>
<p>With agent-based and agentless monitoring options, Zabbix can monitor virtually any infrastructure component. Its template system enables rapid deployment, and the active community provides thousands of ready-to-use templates.</p>
<p>While it requires more initial setup than commercial alternatives, the cost savings and flexibility make it attractive for organizations with technical resources.</p>
</section>
